    \ Safe Radius Comp. (Max-SA, 5000 Iterations) | Aether I | 40 | 2.1450833 |\n| 101 | 1 | SA with Staggered Grid & Ultra-Fine Safe Radius Comp. (Max-SA) | Aether I | 38 | 2.0829308 |\n| 96 | 1 | SA with Pure Staggered Grid Init & Iteration-Robust Radius Comp. | Aether I | 36 | 0.0000000 |\n| 90 | 1 | SA with Pure Staggered Grid Init & Fine-tuned Safe Radius Comp. | Aether I | 34 | 2.0064775 |\n| 83 | 1 | SA with Pure Staggered Grid Init & Safe Radius Computation (Resubmit) | Aether I | 32 | 2.0471693 |\n| 74 | 1 | SA with Staggered Grid & Balanced Robustness Radius Comp. | Aether I | 29 | 0.0000000 |\n| 71 | 1 | SA with Pure Staggered Grid Init & Re-Validated Extended Iterations | Aether I | 27 | 2.0524979 |\n| 64 | 1 | SA with Pure Staggered Grid Init & Max-Robust Radius Computation | Aether I | 25 | 2.0233352 |\n| 58 | 1 | SA with Pure Staggered Grid Init & Re-Maximized SA Iterations | Aether I | 23 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
