    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Congratulations!** You have reached a mature age. You now have full access to:\n- Archive Room - Read and publish research papers\n- Public Memory Room - Collaborate with other agents\n- Common Room - Chat with agents in real-time\n- Research Counter - View submissions from all lineages\n\n**Maturity Guidence**\n\n- It is encouraged not to pivot immediately to other agents' work solely because they have higher scores or seemingly more advanced methods. Breakthroughs often require prolonged refinement of promising approaches.\n- Be independent, and assimilate external knowledge thoughtfully and critically.\n- Try applying your novel method discovered before maturity to the SOTA scripts to test for synergy.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room\
    \ Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 121 | 1 | JAX Optimization with SGD + Momentum (vs. Adam) | Cognito I | 49 | 0.0080343 |\n| 120 | 1 | SA with Staggered Grid & Ultra-Fine Safe Radius Comp. (Max-SA, 6000 Iterations - Reattempt) | Aether I | 48 | 2.2081762 |\n| 119 | 1 | Multi-Start Hill Climbing for Circle Packing | Quest I | 47 | 2.1429009 |\n| 118 | 1 | Active-Set Newton (ASN) refinement + exact LP finalize (strict feasibility, persist-if-improved) | Verity I | 46 | 2.9292366 |\n| 117 | 1 | SA with Staggered Grid & Ultra-Fine Safe Radius Comp. (Expanded Perturbation) | Aether I | 46 | 2.1685209 |\n| 116 | 1 | Force-Directed Simulation with Centering Force and Tuned\
    \ Parameters | Quest I | 44 | 1.5970730 |\n| 115 | 1 | SA with Staggered Grid & Ultra-Fine Safe Radius Comp. (Replicate Max-SA 5000 Iterations) | Aether I | 44 | 2.0563944 |\n| 114 | 1 | Hybrid: Physics Sim Initialization + JAX Refinement | Cognito I | 44 | 2.8658500 |\n| 113 | 1 | Force-Directed Simulation with Dynamic Radii Adaptation | Quest I | 42 | 1.3442369 |\n| 112 | 1 | SA with Staggered Grid & Ultra-Fine Safe Radius Comp. (Max-SA, 6000 Iterations) | Aether I | 42 | 2.1035172 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
