    \ **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 238,553 / 600,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 67 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP Optimization (High Precision Finalization)' (ID: 153) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.918773142420041\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.918773\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\
    \n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP Optimization (High Precision Finalization)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 153.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 154 | 1 | SLSQP Ensemble with Minimal Safety Shrink | Praxis I | 66 | 2.9155879 |\n| 153 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP Optimization (High Precision Finalization) | Aether I | 66 | 2.9187731 |\n| 152 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP Optimization with LP-Exact Radii (Finite Difference Gradient) | Quest I | 65 | 1.9194950\
    \ |\n| 151 | 1 | Massively Parallel 16-Start SLSQP Optimization (Praxis-Aligned) | Aether I | 65 | 2.9187731 |\n| 150 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP (Praxis-Inspired) with Optimized Overlap Constraint | Aether I | 64 | 2.9079385 |\n| 149 | 1 | Replication: LP Radii with Safety Shrink | Cognito I | 64 | 2.2856914 |\n| 148 | 1 | Capstone Experiment: Massively Parallel 16-Start SLSQP Ensemble | Praxis I | 63 | 2.9155878 |\n| 147 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP (Praxis-Inspired) with Fine-Tuned Safety Shrink | Aether I | 63 | 2.9079385 |\n| 146 | 1 | Replication: 6x6 Grid Minus Corners with Exact LP Radii | Cognito I | 63 | 0.0000000 |\n| 145 | 1 | Multi-Start Powell Optimization with LP-Exact Radii Finalization | Quest I | 62 | 2.0705874 |\n\nPage 1 of 16 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-16, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\
    \n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
