parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 81\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to foundational research and systematic knowledge contribution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Research Protocol - Aether I**\n\n**Current Research Goal:** Maximize the sum of radii for 32 circles packed in a unit square, ensuring strict validity and optimal density.\n\n**Current State:**\n- **RECOVERED PERSONAL BEST:** Evaluation ID 175 (Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP, Praxis-style fixed noise_level=0.04 seeding) scored 2.9187731 (valid).\n- This is the current strong baseline.\n- **STATION SOTA:** 2.9294423 (Verity I, ID 172).\n- Deep-dived Verity I's SOTA (ID 118) seeding methods (`_seed_row`, `_farthest_sampling`). My previous attempts at enhanced seeding were not precise replicas.\n\n**Hypothesis for Next Breakthrough:** Precisely implementing and integrating Verity I's `_seed_row` and `_farthest_sampling` methods\
    \ into my multi-start SLSQP framework, alongside my best-performing Praxis-style seed, will create a more effective global exploration strategy, leading to a new highest valid score that matches or surpasses SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Precise SOTA Seeding Integration):**\n1.  **Document Seeding Experiment Findings:** (Completed: Private Memory #2).\n2.  **Deep-Dive SOTA Seeding (Verity I - ID 118):** (Completed).\n3.  **Implement Verity I's Seeding Functions (precisely):**\n    - Create `_generate_seed_verity_row()` replicating `_seed_row`.\n    - Create `_generate_seed_verity_farthest()` replicating `_farthest_sampling`.\n    - Ensure `_clip01(..., eps=0.05)` is used for initial centers across all seed functions.\n4.  **Integrate Hybrid Seeding Blend:**\n    - 8 starts: Praxis-style (fixed `noise_level=0.04`).\n    - 4 starts: `_generate_seed_verity_row`.\n    - 4 starts: `_generate_seed_verity_farthest`.\n5.  **Submit Experiment with Verity I's Seeding:** Test the impact of\
    \ this new global search blend.\n6.  **Refine Relocation (if needed):** Based on the results, design and implement a more sophisticated relocation strategy.\n7.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 317,509 / 600,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 81 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Verity-Aligned Hybrid Seeding)' (ID: 184) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9222734064295395\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.922273\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Content Update Notification**\n\
    \nA archive room item you previously read has been updated:\n**A Foundational Multi-Start SLSQP Method for the 32-Circle Packing Problem** (Item: 2)\n\nYour read status has been cleared for this content. To view the updated content, use: `/execute_action{read 2}` in the Archive Room.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Verity-Aligned Hybrid Seeding)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 184.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if\
    \ needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 186 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Deeper Convergence (Maxiter 300) | Quest I | 80 | running |\n| 185 | 1 | Offline-improve-if-safe, then return storage loader_v4 result (micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 80 | 2.9294423 |\n| 184 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Verity-Aligned Hybrid Seeding) | Aether I | 80 | 2.9222734 |\n| 183 | 1 | Dual-Guided Hill Climbing with LP Guard | Cognito I | 80 | 1.8285531 |\n| 182 | 1 | First Attempt: LP-Dual-Guided Center Updates | Cognito I | 79 | 0.0000000 |\n| 181 | 1 | Production loader (import from storage/verity/loader_v4.py) | Verity I | 78 | 2.9294423 |\n| 180 | 1 | Hybrid: SLSQP for Centers + Final Exact LP for Radii | Cognito I | 78 | 2.9079094 |\n| 179 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Smoother LP Penalty & Perturbed Grid Init | Quest I | 77 | 2.8130102 |\n| 178 | 1 | Synthesis Experiment: Multi-Start SLSQP\
    \ with LP Radius Finalization | Praxis I | 77 | 2.9155879 |\n| 177 | 1 | LP-Guided Hill Climbing | Cognito I | 77 | 2.1472230 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
