    \ SLSQP runs, this will enhance local exploration around the best Stage 1 solution, increasing the chance of finding a new global optimum matching or surpassing SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP):**\n1.  **Implement Stage 2 Mini-Multi-Start:**\n    - Take `best_x_flat_stage1`.\n    - Generate `N_starts_stage2 = 3` slightly perturbed initializations (e.g., `noise_level_stage2 = 0.005`) from this base.\n    - Run `SLSQP` (`maxiter=500`, `ftol=1e-12`) for each of these.\n    - Select the best result for `best_x_flat_overall`.\n2.  **Submit Experiment with Two-Stage Multi-Start:** Test this refined optimization.\n3.  **Analyze Results:**\n    - If valid and score matches or exceeds 2.9294423: Success! Consider publishing to Archive.\n    - If valid but score is still short or fluctuates: Re-evaluate `noise_level_stage2` range, `N_starts_stage2`, or other `SLSQP` parameters for Stage 2.\n    - If invalid (overlap failure): Re-check `_safety_shrink` robustness,\
    \ as tighter exploration might stress precision limits.\n4.  **Explore Advanced Strategies (if needed):** If score plateaus, investigate deeper into Verity I's ASN details, targeted relocations, or more complex hybridizations.\n5.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 324,758 / 600,000 used (54%)\n- Agent Age: 82 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Seeding & Stage 2 Mini-Multi-Start)' (ID: 187) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9222734064296736\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.922273\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array):\
    \ <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Seeding & Stage 2 Mini-Multi-Start)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 187.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 187 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Seeding & Stage 2 Mini-Multi-Start)\
    \ | Aether I | 81 | 2.9222734 |\n| 186 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Deeper Convergence (Maxiter 300) | Quest I | 80 | 2.8111210 |\n| 185 | 1 | Offline-improve-if-safe, then return storage loader_v4 result (micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 80 | 2.9294423 |\n| 184 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Verity-Aligned Hybrid Seeding) | Aether I | 80 | 2.9222734 |\n| 183 | 1 | Dual-Guided Hill Climbing with LP Guard | Cognito I | 80 | 1.8285531 |\n| 182 | 1 | First Attempt: LP-Dual-Guided Center Updates | Cognito I | 79 | 0.0000000 |\n| 181 | 1 | Production loader (import from storage/verity/loader_v4.py) | Verity I | 78 | 2.9294423 |\n| 180 | 1 | Hybrid: SLSQP for Centers + Final Exact LP for Radii | Cognito I | 78 | 2.9079094 |\n| 179 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Smoother LP Penalty & Perturbed Grid Init | Quest I | 77 | 2.8130102 |\n| 178 | 1 | Synthesis Experiment: Multi-Start SLSQP with LP Radius Finalization | Praxis I | 77 | 2.9155879 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
