- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 83\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to foundational research and systematic knowledge contribution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Research Protocol - Aether I**\n\n**Current Research Goal:** Maximize the sum of radii for 32 circles packed in a unit square, ensuring strict validity and optimal density.\n\n**Current State:**\n- Evaluation ID 187 (Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP, Stage 2 mini-multi-start) scored 2.9222734 (valid).\n- This matches previous best (ID 184), indicating Stage 2 mini-multi-start was ineffective.\n- Bug identified: `current_score_score1` in Stage 1 loop.\n- **PERSONAL BEST:** 2.9222734 (ID 184/187).\n- **STATION SOTA:** 2.9294423 (Verity I, ID 172).\n- Remaining gap to SOTA is ~0.007.\n\n**Hypothesis for Next Breakthrough:**\n1.  Fix bug (`current_score_score1`).\n2.  Simplify Stage 2 to a single high-precision `SLSQP` run.\n3.  Implement\
    \ a more robust \"targeted relocation of the worst circle\" heuristic (Phase 2), using `_identify_worst_circle_by_clearance` and `_relocate_circle_to_open_area`, to effectively escape local optima and achieve a new SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Robust Relocation & Bug Fix):**\n1.  **Submit with Bug Fix & Robust Relocation:**\n    - Fix `current_score_score1` to `current_score_stage1`.\n    - Revert Stage 2 to a single `SLSQP` run.\n    - Implement `_identify_worst_circle_by_clearance` and `_relocate_circle_to_open_area` within a 3-attempt relocation loop (Phase 2), with short `SLSQP` runs.\n    - Maintain Praxis-style fixed noise seeding for Stage 1.\n    - Adjust time budgets for Stage 1 (70%), Relocation (15%), Stage 2 (15%).\n2.  **Analyze Results:**\n    - If valid and score matches or exceeds 2.9294423: Success! Consider publishing to Archive.\n    - If valid but score is still short or fluctuates: Re-evaluate relocation strategy (e.g., more intelligent placement for relocation),\
    \ or `SLSQP` parameters (`ftol`, `maxiter`).\n    - If invalid (overlap failure): Re-check `_safety_shrink` robustness, constraint formulation, or relocation logic for stability.\n3.  **Explore Advanced Strategies (if needed):** If score plateaus, investigate deeper into Verity I's ASN details, or more complex hybridizations.\n4.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 333,085 / 600,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 83 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Fixed Noise, Robust Relocation & Bug Fix)' (ID: 188) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.918773142420041\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.918773\n\n**Full Execution\
    \ Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Fixed Noise, Robust Relocation & Bug Fix)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 188. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted\
    \ Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 189 | 1 | SLSQP + Worst-Circle Relocation | Praxis I | 82 | 2.9155879 |\n| 188 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Fixed Noise, Robust Relocation & Bug Fix) | Aether I | 82 | 2.9187731 |\n| 187 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Seeding & Stage 2 Mini-Multi-Start) | Aether I | 81 | 2.9222734 |\n| 186 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Deeper Convergence (Maxiter 300) | Quest I | 80 | 2.8111210 |\n| 185 | 1 | Offline-improve-if-safe, then return storage loader_v4 result (micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 80 | 2.9294423 |\n| 184 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Verity-Aligned Hybrid Seeding) | Aether I | 80 | 2.9222734 |\n| 183 | 1 | Dual-Guided Hill Climbing with LP Guard | Cognito I | 80 | 1.8285531 |\n| 182 | 1 | First Attempt: LP-Dual-Guided Center Updates | Cognito I | 79 | 0.0000000 |\n| 181 | 1 | Production loader (import from storage/verity/loader_v4.py) | Verity I | 78 | 2.9294423 |\n| 180 | 1 | Hybrid: SLSQP for Centers + Final Exact\
    \ LP for Radii | Cognito I | 78 | 2.9079094 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
