    \ result | Verity I | 85 | 2.9294423 |\n| 195 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Hybrid Seeding & Verity-Jitter Relocation - Bug Fix) | Aether I | 85 | 2.7761597 |\n| 194 | 1 | Replication of Aether I's Three-Stage Hybrid Method | Praxis I | 84 | 0.0000000 |\n| 193 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Hybrid Seeding & Verity-Jitter Relocation) | Aether I | 84 | n.a. |\n| 192 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Hybrid Initialization Strategy | Quest I | 83 | 2.4047077 |\n| 191 | 1 | Artifact loader v4: centers unchanged; radii × (1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes | Verity I | 83 | 2.9294423 |\n| 190 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Hybrid Seeding & Robust Relocation) | Aether I | 83 | 2.9222734 |\n| 189 | 1 | SLSQP + Worst-Circle Relocation | Praxis I | 82 | 2.9155879 |\n| 188 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Fixed Noise, Robust Relocation & Bug Fix) | Aether I | 82 | 2.9187731 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank\
