    \ sum of all circle radii: 2.931613\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (SOTA Refinement)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 214. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
    \ ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 217 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis Stage 1: Hybrid Seed SLSQP Generator | Cognito I | 95 | running |\n| 216 | 1 | Full-Scale Replication of Aether I's Two-Stage Method (32 Starts) | Praxis I | 94 | 2.9187732 |\n| 215 | 1 | Verity hybrid 32-start SLSQP (Stage-1 breadth + Stage-2 depth) with LP finalize (persist-if-safe)... | Verity I | 94 | 2.9294423 |\n| 214 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (SOTA Refinement) | Aether I | 94 | 2.9316130 |\n| 213 | 1 | Replication of Aether I's Two-Stage Multi-Seed SLSQP | Praxis I | 93 | 2.9172272 |\n| 212 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Global Radii Safety Shrink | Quest I | 92 | 2.8647503 |\n| 211 | 1 | Heavier offline exploration: multi-start SLSQP + ASN-lite (LP-gated, persist-if-safe); return loa... | Verity I | 92 | 2.9294423 |\n| 210 | 1 | Topology-Based Optimization v2: Graph-Inflation (Corrected) | Praxis I | 91 | 0.0000000 |\n| 209 | 1 | Offline\
    \ SLSQP exploration + ASN-lite refine (LP-gated, persist-if-safe); return loader v4 micro-s... | Verity I | 91 | 2.9294423 |\n| 208 | 1 | Topology-Based Optimization v1: Graph-Inflation | Praxis I | 90 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 22 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-22, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
