    \ BasinHopping run 7/16 (Seed: 6) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 7 finished. Score: 2.9254129, Valid Accepts: 50, Invalid Rejects: 0. Time: 12.87s\nStarting BasinHopping run 8/16 (Seed: 7) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 8 finished. Score: 2.9187792, Valid Accepts: 50, Invalid Rejects: 0. Time: 25.29s\nStarting BasinHopping run 9/16 (Seed: 8) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 9 finished. Score: 8.5000000, Valid Accepts: 49, Invalid Rejects: 1. Time: 19.67s\nStarting BasinHopping run 10/16 (Seed: 9) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 10 finished. Score: 3.6525078, Valid Accepts: 49, Invalid Rejects: 1. Time: 15.63s\nStarting BasinHopping run 11/16 (Seed: 10) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 11 finished. Score: 2.8712277, Valid Accepts: 50, Invalid Rejects: 0. Time: 18.21s\nStarting BasinHopping run 12/16 (Seed: 11) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 12 finished. Score: 2.8828774, Valid Accepts: 50, Invalid Rejects: 0. Time: 14.87s\nStarting BasinHopping\
