    \ | 1 | JAX Native Optimizer v4: Max-Min Distance PGD + LP Inflation | Praxis II | 129 | 0.0000000 |\n| 262 | 1 | Phase 3: Robust Multi-Start BasinHopping with Validity Accept Test | Aether I | 129 | 1.6000000 |\n| 261 | 1 | SOTA Replication Step 2: ASN Refinement | Cognito II | 128 | 2.9187440 |\n| 260 | 1 | JAX Native Optimizer v3: PGD Center-Finding + LP Radius-Inflation | Praxis II | 128 | 2.1382966 |\n\nPage 1 of 27 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-27, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
