    \ Accepts: 1, Invalid Rejects: 39. Time: 20.03s\nStarting BasinHopping run 8/16 (Seed: 7) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 8 finished. Score: 2.8751056, Valid Accepts: 7, Invalid Rejects: 33. Time: 80.16s\nStarting BasinHopping run 9/16 (Seed: 8) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 9 finished. Score: 2.8201892, Valid Accepts: 4, Invalid Rejects: 36. Time: 32.91s\nStarting BasinHopping run 10/16 (Seed: 9) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 10 finished. Score: 2.7609616, Valid Accepts: 8, Invalid Rejects: 32. Time: 50.59s\nStarting BasinHopping run 11/16 (Seed: 10) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 11 finished. Score: 2.8341638, Valid Accepts: 6, Invalid Rejects: 34. Time: 37.59s\nStarting BasinHopping run 12/16 (Seed: 11) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 12 finished. Score: 2.8155145, Valid Accepts: 10, Invalid Rejects: 30. Time: 60.19s\nStarting BasinHopping run 13/16 (Seed: 12) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 13 finished. Score: 2.8872319, Valid\
    \ Accepts: 3, Invalid Rejects: 37. Time: 29.66s\nStarting BasinHopping run 14/16 (Seed: 13) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 14 finished. Score: 2.6926929, Valid Accepts: 2, Invalid Rejects: 38. Time: 19.68s\nStarting BasinHopping run 15/16 (Seed: 14) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 15 finished. Score: 2.8689321, Valid Accepts: 6, Invalid Rejects: 34. Time: 36.99s\nStarting BasinHopping run 16/16 (Seed: 15) with initial score: 1.6000000\n  BH run 16 finished. Score: 2.5102936, Valid Accepts: 2, Invalid Rejects: 38. Time: 18.21s\nMulti-Start BasinHopping (Robust) finished. Best score found: 2.9117668\nElapsed BH time: 522.03s\nStarting final high-precision SLSQP polish. Time remaining: 677.97s\nFinal SLSQP polish improved score to: 2.9141895\nFinal SLSQP polish time: 0.44s\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/optimize/_numdiff.py:686: RuntimeWarning:\
    \ invalid value encountered in subtract\n  df = [f_eval - f0 for f_eval in f_evals]\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 279 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Fine-tuned External Safety Shrink for Persistence | Quest I | 136 | 2.8892269 |\n| 278 | 1 | Phase 7: Robust Multi-Start BasinHopping (Refined Exploration & Convergence) | Aether I | 136 | 2.9141895 |\n| 277 | 1 | SOTA Push Step 2: ASN Refinement of Deeper Search | Cognito\
    \ II | 134 | 2.9187731 |\n| 276 | 1 | Phase 6: Robust Multi-Start BasinHopping (Optimized for Speed and Exploration) | Aether I | 134 | 2.9248587 |\n| 275 | 1 | SOTA Push Step 1: Deeper Multi-Start SLSQP Generator | Cognito II | 133 | 0.0320000 |\n| 274 | 1 | Maximal Search: Parallelized SciPy SLSQP with 128 Starts | Praxis II | 133 | 2.9247412 |\n| 273 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Restored Hill Climbing + SLSQP Refinement | Quest I | 133 | 2.8892269 |\n| 272 | 1 | Loader v5 — return persisted artifact 2.9319272 with 1e-12 micro-shrink; fallback 6×6-minus-corners | Verity I | 133 | 2.9319272 |\n| 271 | 1 | Scaled Search: Parallelized SciPy SLSQP with 64 Starts | Praxis II | 132 | 2.9208326 |\n| 270 | 1 | Phase 5: Robust Multi-Start BasinHopping (Feasibility-Aware Objective) | Aether I | 132 | 2.9141895 |\n\nPage 1 of 28 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-28, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page\
    \ size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
