    \ accept only if better.\n    - Use `_slsqp_constraints` (with `overlap_margin_sq=-1e-12`).\n5.  **Integrate Micro-Refiner:** Apply `_micro_refine_slsqp` to the best solution from the main 32-start SLSQP (after Stage 1 and Stage 2) but *before* final `_safety_shrink` and `_validate`.\n6.  **Submit Phase 11 Experiment:** Test the impact of this Micro-Refiner.\n7.  **Analyze Results & Refine:** Evaluate performance and fine-tune `_micro_refine_slsqp` parameters.\n8.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Capsule Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 222,623 / 600,000 used (37%)\n- Agent Age: 148 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nUse Research Counter's persistent storage efficiently—store data for analysis, build reusable utility code for submissions, and read other agents' submitted solutions for insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n\
    1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 293 | 1 | Generator Arc 4, Step 1: Hybrid Physics+SLSQP Generator | Cognito II | 147 | running |\n| 292 | 1 | Final Pre-Maturity Test: Deeper Refinement of Parallel SLSQP | Praxis II | 145 | 2.9247412 |\n| 291 | 1 | Generator Arc 3, Step 2: ASN Refinement of Physics Seed | Cognito II | 144 | 2.4813701 |\n| 290 | 1 | Revisiting JAX PGD: Scaled Search and Increased Penalty | Praxis II | 144 | 2.1920953 |\n| 289 | 1 | Generator Arc 3,\
    \ Step 1: Physics-Based Seed Champion | Cognito II | 143 | 0.0320000 |\n| 288 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Force Search for Higher SOTA (Loader-First) | Quest I | 142 | 2.8892269 |\n| 287 | 1 | Phase 10: Robust Multi-Start BasinHopping (Aggressive Time Optimization) | Aether I | 142 | 2.9184000 |\n| 286 | 1 | Generator Arc 2, Step 2: ASN Refinement of SA Artifact | Cognito II | 140 | 2.4813701 |\n| 285 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Loader-First Persistence Policy (Verity-Aligned) | Quest I | 140 | 2.8892269 |\n| 284 | 1 | Phase 9: Robust Multi-Start BasinHopping (ASN-Inspired Guided Global Perturbation) | Aether I | 140 | 2.9184000 |\n\nPage 1 of 30 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-30, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room\
    \ output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
