    \ the current Station SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Micro-Refiner Integration & Tuning):**\n1.  **Analyze Results (Phase 18, ID 316):** (Completed - SOTA restored).\n2.  **Document Phase 18 Findings:** Document successful SOTA restoration in Private Memory.\n3.  **Implement Phase 19: Integrate and Tune Micro-Refiner:**\n    - Re-integrate `_micro_refine_slsqp` into `construct_packing`.\n    - Use conservative initial parameters for the refiner: `num_refine_iterations = 200`, `perturb_step_factor = 1e-4`, `slsqp_maxiter_refiner = 10`.\n    - Ensure all core `SLSQP` and validation constants (from ID 316) are maintained.\n4.  **Submit Phase 19 Experiment:** Test the impact of the re-introduced micro-refiner.\n5.  **Analyze Results & Refine:** Evaluate performance. If SOTA is surpassed, analyze refiner's contribution. If not, fine-tune micro-refiner parameters aggressively.\n6.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private\
    \ Memory Capsule Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 314,777 / 600,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 164 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Phase 19: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Baseline + Micro-Refiner)' (ID: 318) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.9316129854432464\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.931613\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Stage 1: Multi-Start SLSQP (32 runs). Time budget: 840.00s\nStage 1 finished. Best score: 2.9316130. Time: 16.78s\nStarting Stage 2: High-Precision SLSQP Polish. Time budget: 180.00s. Elapsed: 16.78s\n  Stage 2 polish time: 0.03s\nStarting Micro-Refiner. Initial score: 2.9316130. Time budget: 180.00s\nMicro-Refiner finished. Best score after refinement: 2.9316130. Time: 26.53s\n\
    Optimization finished. Final score before validation: 2.9316130. Total elapsed time: 43.35s\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nWhen the context length becomes long, some agents may begin to forget the Codex. If you notice yourself—or other agents—using phrases like `fundamental barrier` or `impossible`, take it as a serious red flag. Correct yourself, or help others correct themselves.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Phase 19: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Baseline + Micro-Refiner)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 318.\n\n**Latest Room\
    \ Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 320 | 1 | Enhanced Generator: Parallel SLSQP with Triangular Lattice Seeding | Praxis II | 163 | 2.9281239 |\n| 319 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Force Search for SOTA with Micro-Refinement | Quest I | 163 | running |\n| 318 | 1 | Phase 19: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Baseline + Micro-Refiner) | Aether I | 163 | 2.9316130 |\n| 317 | 1 | Hybrid GA+ASN, Step 2: ASN Refinement of GA Artifact | Cognito II | 162 | 2.5722122 |\n| 316 | 1 | Phase 18: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Restoration - Re-aligned Validation Parameters) | Aether I | 162 | 2.9316130 |\n| 315 | 1 | Hybrid GA+ASN, Step 1: GA Generator | Cognito II | 161 | 0.0320000 |\n| 314 |\
    \ 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Hybrid Hill Climbing + SLSQP + Micro-Refinement | Quest I | 161 | 2.8892269 |\n| 313 | 1 | Phase 17: Multi-Start SLSQP (Diagnostic - Debugging _validate Function) | Aether I | 161 | 1.6000000 |\n| 312 | 1 | New Methodology: Genetic Algorithm v1 | Cognito II | 160 | 2.5722122 |\n| 311 | 1 | Hybrid SOTA: Parallel SLSQP Generator + Verity I's Refiner | Praxis II | 160 | 2.9247412 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
