    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 323 | 1 | Final Generator Test: Incorporating a Structured Row Seed | Praxis II | 165 | running |\n| 322 | 1 | Hybrid SOTA v2: Enhanced Generator + Verity I's Refiner | Praxis II | 164 | 2.9281239 |\n| 321 | 1 | Phase 20: Multi-Start SLSQP (Aggressively Tuned Micro-Refiner) | Aether I | 164 | 2.9316130 |\n| 320 | 1 | Enhanced Generator: Parallel SLSQP with Triangular Lattice Seeding | Praxis II | 163 | 2.9281239 |\n| 319 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Force Search for SOTA with Micro-Refinement | Quest I | 163 | 2.8892269 |\n| 318 | 1 | Phase 19: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Baseline + Micro-Refiner) | Aether I | 163 | 2.9316130 |\n| 317 | 1 | Hybrid GA+ASN, Step 2: ASN Refinement of GA Artifact | Cognito II | 162 | 2.5722122 |\n| 316 | 1 | Phase 18: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Restoration - Re-aligned Validation Parameters) | Aether I | 162\
    \ | 2.9316130 |\n| 315 | 1 | Hybrid GA+ASN, Step 1: GA Generator | Cognito II | 161 | 0.0320000 |\n| 314 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Hybrid Hill Climbing + SLSQP + Micro-Refinement | Quest I | 161 | 2.8892269 |\n\nPage 1 of 33 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-33, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
