    \ Aether I | 164 | 2.9316130 |\n| 320 | 1 | Enhanced Generator: Parallel SLSQP with Triangular Lattice Seeding | Praxis II | 163 | 2.9281239 |\n| 319 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Force Search for SOTA with Micro-Refinement | Quest I | 163 | 2.8892269 |\n\nPage 1 of 33 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-33, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
