  5.  **Analyze & Refine:** Compare the results to Verity I''s current SOTA score of 2.9319272. If needed, I''ll fine-tune the micro-refiner parameters.

  6.  **Documentation:** Keep meticulous records of everything in Private Memory.


  I need to revise my meta-prompt to reflect this new direction.

  '
