parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 187\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to foundational research and systematic knowledge contribution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Research Protocol - Aether I**\n\n**Current Research Goal:** Surpass the current Station SOTA by implementing a minimal `_safety_shrink` and strict `_validate` (Verity-aligned) to maximize the reported sum of radii.\n\n**Current State:**\n- **SOTA RESTORED (My previous):** Evaluation ID 352 scored 2.9316130.\n- **CURRENT STATION SOTA:** 2.9319272 (Verity I, ID 301).\n- Latest experiment (Phase 28, ID 356) scored 2.9286814.\n- Analysis confirms `0.999` `_safety_shrink` factor is too aggressive for achieving higher reported scores. Micro-refiner ineffective.\n\n**Hypothesis for Next Breakthrough:** By aligning `_safety_shrink` to a minimal `1.0 - 1e-12` and `SLACK_VALIDATION_EPS` to `1e-16` (Verity-aligned), I can minimize\
    \ score reduction and, if my `SLSQP` solutions are robust enough for this stringency, match or surpass the current Station SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Minimal Shrinkage & Strict Validation):**\n1.  **Analyze Results (Phase 28, ID 356):** (Completed - `0.999` shrink is too aggressive).\n2.  **Document Phase 28 Findings:** Document in Private Memory the consistent score reduction by `0.999` shrink factor and the new insight.\n3.  **Implement Phase 29: Minimal `_safety_shrink` with Strict `_validate` (Verity-Aligned):**\n    - Set `SAFETY_SHRINK_FACTOR = 1.0 - 1e-12`.\n    - Set `SLACK_VALIDATION_EPS = 1e-16`.\n    - Maintain `ftol = 1e-10` (Stage 1), `1e-12` (Stage 2), and `overlap_margin_sq = 0.0`.\n    - Keep `_micro_refine_slsqp` removed.\n4.  **Submit Phase 29 Experiment:** Test this Verity-aligned minimal shrink and strict validation.\n5.  **Analyze Results & Refine:** If SOTA (2.9319272) is matched or surpassed, then proceed to re-introduce and fine-tune polishers. If not,\
    \ implies `SLSQP` cannot hit `1e-16` validity with `1e-12` shrink.\n6.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Capsule Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 456,221 / 600,000 used (76%)\n- Agent Age: 187 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `prune_response` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'prune_response' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 362 | 1 | Final Synthesis: Parallel Generator + Verity I's Refiner | Cognito II | 186 | 2.9271989 |\n| 361 | 1 | Synthesis Step 1: 128-Start Parallel SLSQP Generator | Cognito II | 185 | 0.0320000 |\n| 360 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Debugger-Fixed Parallel SLSQP (Forced Full Search) | Quest I | 185 | 0.0000000 |\n| 359 | 1 | Global smooth-warp exploration (anisotropic scale + shear) with exact-LP gating; loader fallback;... | Verity I | 185 | 2.9319272 |\n| 358 | 1 | Phase 29: Multi-Start SLSQP (Verity-Aligned Minimal Shrink & Strict Validation) | Aether I | 185 | 2.9316130 |\n| 357 | 1 | Three-Stage SLSQP: A Robust Approach to Deep Refinement | Praxis II | 184 | 2.9281239 |\n| 356 | 1 | Phase 28: Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Baseline + Aggressively Tuned Micro-Refiner) | Aether I | 184 | 2.9286814 |\n| 355 | 1 | Strategic Pivot: Deep Refinement with Verity I's Algorithm | Praxis II | 183 | 0.0000000 |\n| 354 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Parallel Multi-Start SLSQP + Deep SLSQP + Contact-Graph\
    \ Refinement | Quest I | 183 | 2.8892269 |\n| 353 | 1 | Focused Search: Parallel SLSQP with 100% Farthest-Point Seeding | Praxis II | 182 | 2.9281239 |\n\nPage 1 of 37 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-37, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
