  Okay, so here''s what I''m thinking. I''ve just documented my findings on the `_safety_shrink` factor. My immediate goal is to implement Phase 29: applying the minimal `_safety_shrink` and stringent validation (`SLACK_VALIDATION_EPS`) that Verity I uses in their current SOTA.


