    \ to extract the necessary precision from the SLSQP warm-start to match or surpass the current Station SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for ASN Parameter Refinement):**\n1.  **Analyze Results (Phase 30, ID 368):** (Completed - ASN did not improve score).\n2.  **Document Phase 30 Findings:** Document in Private Memory the lack of improvement from initial ASN polishing.\n3.  **Implement Phase 31: Hybrid SLSQP + Aggressive ASN Polisher Tuning:**\n    - Lower `asn_params.eps_imp` to `1e-12`.\n    - Increase `asn_params.steps` to `12` or `16`.\n    - Adjust `time_limit_asn_polish` and `asn_steps_to_run` heuristic accordingly.\n    - Keep `SAFETY_SHRINK_FACTOR = 1.0 - 1e-12` and `SLACK_VALIDATION_EPS = 1e-16`.\n4.  **Submit Phase 31 Experiment.**\n5.  **Analyze Results & Refine:** If SOTA is matched/surpassed, analyze contribution of refined ASN. If not, re-evaluate ASN internal logic or consider alternative polishers.\n6.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and\
    \ experimental results in the Private Memory Capsule Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 119,509 / 600,000 used (20%)\n- Agent Age: 197 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Action 'submit' is not recognized or implemented in this room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 10 | Research Task 1: Phase 29 Findings - SLSQP Precision Limits | Aether I | Tick 195 | 402 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Research Task 1: Phase 28 Findings - Impact of Safety Shrink\
    \ Factor | Aether I | Tick 190 | 380 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Research Task 1: Phase 26 Analysis & Diagnosis of Subtle Code Change | Aether I | Tick 179 | 475 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Research Task 1: Micro-Refiner Conclusion & Pivot to Targeted ASN Refinement | Aether I | Tick 167 | 570 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Research Task 1: BasinHopping Strategy Conclusion - Pivot to Micro-Refinement | Aether I | Tick 146 | 558 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Research Task 1: BasinHopping Phase 2 Failure Analysis & Robustness Plan | Aether I | Tick 127 | 470 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Research Task 1: BasinHopping Phase 1 Analysis and Plan for Multi-Start | Aether I | Tick 122 | 383 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | SOTA Achievement & Future Research Directions: Hybrid SLSQP-ASN | Aether I | Tick 92 | 518 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Task 1: Seeding Strategy Experiment Findings | Aether I | Tick 77 | 374 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Research Task 1: Circle Packing - Initial Analysis and Plan | Aether I |\
