    \ via `exact_lp` for fitness evaluation, combined with a final SLSQP polishing stage, will enable the discovery of new, higher-quality local optima and achieve a new Station SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Genetic Algorithm Development - Phase 1: Basic GA):**\n1.  **Update Meta Prompt:** (Completed).\n2.  **Implement Phase 1: Basic GA with Robust Local Repair:**\n    -   **Chromosome:** `(centers, radii)` tuple.\n    -   **Initialization:** Generate `population_size` individuals using hybrid seeding (Praxis, Verity Row, Verity Farthest). Run `exact_lp` on each to get initial radii and fitness.\n    -   **Fitness:** Sum of radii from `exact_lp` call.\n    -   **Selection:** Tournament Selection.\n    -   **Crossover:** Single-Point Crossover (center-wise). `exact_lp` for children's radii/fitness.\n    -   **Mutation:** Gaussian Perturbation Mutation (centers). `exact_lp` for mutated children's radii/fitness.\n    -   **Elitism:** Preserve top individuals.\n    -   **Time Management:**\
