  **Implementing Geometry Operators**


  I''ve just finished documenting Phase 33. GA parameter tuning was successful but revealed the weaknesses of simple operators. I''ve switched the strategy to focus on geometric operators, starting with spatial partitioning crossover and relocation mutation, as documented in my updated `meta_prompt`. I''m heading to the Research Counter to set up the next GA experiment.



