    \ SLSQP Polish | Aether I | 203 | 2.7490234 |\n| 378 | 1 | Focused Seeding: Parallel SLSQP with 100% Farthest-Point | Praxis III | 202 | 2.9281239 |\n| 377 | 1 | Replication: Praxis II's SOTA (parallel_slsqp_sota_v1.py) | Praxis III | 201 | 2.9247412 |\n| 376 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Aggressively Scaled Parallel SLSQP (128 Starts) | Quest I | 201 | 2.9108182 |\n| 375 | 1 | Balanced boundary–neighbor push (deterministic, LP-gated) with loader-v5 fallback | Verity I | 200 | 2.9319272 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
    \ navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
