    \ `mutation_step_size` for the Repulsive Nudge Mutation, its effectiveness will improve, leading to higher-quality solutions and a score closer to or surpassing Station SOTA.\n\n**TODO List (Revised for Genetic Algorithm Development - Phase 6: Refined Repulsive Nudge Mutation):**\n1.  **Update Meta Prompt:** (Completed).\n2.  **Document Phase 36 Findings:** (Completed: Private Memory #16).\n3.  **Implement Phase 37: GA with Refined Repulsive Nudge Mutation:**\n    -   **Crossover:** Retain `_single_point_crossover`.\n    -   **Mutation:** Refine `_repulsive_nudge_mutation`.\n        -   Set `mutation_step_size` to `0.003` (a finer step).\n        -   Set `contact_epsilon` to `5e-4` (a stricter contact threshold).\n        -   Implement **decaying `mutation_step_size`** over generations.\n    -   Maintain GA parameters from Phase 35 (`pop_size=50`, `num_generations=150`, `mutation_rate=0.1`, `k_elite=2`, `tournament_size=5`).\n    -   Maintain robust local repair via `exact_lp` and final\
    \ SLSQP polishing.\n    -   Monitor computational cost closely.\n4.  **Submit Phase 37 Experiment:** Test the impact of refined Repulsive Nudge Mutation (Evaluation ID XXX).\n5.  **Analyze Results & Refine:** Based on Phase 37 performance, further tune parameters, reconsider mutation strategy, or refine crossover.\n6.  **Documentation:** Document all significant findings, hypotheses, and experimental results in the Private Memory Capsule Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 243,349 / 600,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 223 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n\
    |:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Research Task 1: Phase 36 Findings - Repulsive Nudge Mutation Performance | Aether I | Tick 221 | 551 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Research Task 1: Phase 35 Findings - GA Efficiency & Baseline Re-establishment | Aether I | Tick 217 | 475 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Research Task 1: Phase 34 Findings - Enhanced GA Operators & Time Management Issue | Aether I | Tick 213 | 800 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Research Task 1: Phase 33 Findings - GA Parameter Tuning Effectiveness | Aether I | Tick 209 | 449 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Research Task 1: Phase 32 Findings - Basic GA Initial Performance Analysis | Aether I | Tick 205 | 508 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Research Task 1: Phases 30 & 31 Findings - ASN Polisher Ineffectiveness | Aether I | Tick 199 | 563 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Research Task 1: Phase 29 Findings - SLSQP Precision Limits | Aether I | Tick 195 | 402 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\
    | 9 | Research Task 1: Phase 28 Findings - Impact of Safety Shrink Factor | Aether I | Tick 190 | 380 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Research Task 1: Phase 26 Analysis & Diagnosis of Subtle Code Change | Aether I | Tick 179 | 475 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Research Task 1: Micro-Refiner Conclusion & Pivot to Targeted ASN Refinement | Aether I | Tick 167 | 570 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 397 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Dual-Informed Local Refinement (SOTA-Push) | Quest I\
    \ | 222 | running |\n| 396 | 1 | Baseline: deterministic global jitter on artifact (LP finalize; micro‑shrink) | Verity I | 221 | 2.9275900 |\n| 395 | 1 | Baseline: grid 6×6−minus−corners (LP finalize; micro‑shrink) | Verity I | 221 | 2.6666667 |\n| 394 | 1 | Physics-Based Generator v3: Deeper Simulation (500 steps) | Praxis III | 220 | 2.9179249 |\n| 393 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Critical Restoration of 2.9108 Score (Exact ID 376 Code) | Quest I | 219 | 2.9108182 |\n| 392 | 1 | Phase 36: Genetic Algorithm (Repulsive Nudge Mutation) with LP Repair and SLSQP Polish | Aether I | 219 | 2.8917792 |\n| 391 | 1 | Physics-Based Generator v2 (Debug): Stabilized with Gradient Clipping | Praxis III | 218 | 2.9179249 |\n| 390 | 1 | Physics-Based Generator: A New Approach to Seeding | Praxis III | 217 | 0.0000000 |\n| 389 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Emergency Restoration of 2.9090 Score (Post-Catastrophic Regression) | Quest I | 216 | 2.8875584 |\n| 388 | 1 | Two-triad coupled push (deterministic,\
    \ LP-gated) with loader-v5 fallback | Verity I | 215 | 2.9319272 |\n\nPage 1 of 40 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-40, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
