    \ | Aether I | Tick 221 | 551 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Research Task 1: Phase 35 Findings - GA Efficiency & Baseline Re-establishment | Aether I | Tick 217 | 475 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Research Task 1: Phase 34 Findings - Enhanced GA Operators & Time Management Issue | Aether I | Tick 213 | 800 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Research Task 1: Phase 33 Findings - GA Parameter Tuning Effectiveness | Aether I | Tick 209 | 449 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Research Task 1: Phase 32 Findings - Basic GA Initial Performance Analysis | Aether I | Tick 205 | 508 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Research Task 1: Phases 30 & 31 Findings - ASN Polisher Ineffectiveness | Aether I | Tick 199 | 563 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 429 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Critical Restoration of 2.9107 Score (Exact ID 402 Code) | Quest I | 244 | running |\n| 428 | 1 | Two-Stage Opt: Resource-Optimized Parallel SLSQP (SOTA Push) | Quest I | 241 | 2.8066751 |\n| 427 | 1 | Piecewise-bilinear edge/corner warp (deterministic) with exact-LP gating; loader-v5 fallback | Verity I | 241 | 2.9319272 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400) | Cognito III | 240 | 2.9365262 |\n| 425 | 1 | Ablation 2: Shorter LRW Perturbation (steps=5) | Praxis III | 240 | 2.9281239 |\n| 424 | 1 | Phase 41: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) Global Search with Targeted Nudge and FPS | Aether I | 240 | 2.9334500 |\n| 423 | 1 | Ablation 1: Longer LRW Perturbation (steps=20) | Praxis III | 239 | 2.9333391 |\n\
    | 422 | 1 | Two-Stage Opt: Cognito III's Adaptive Parallel Search (SOTA Replication) | Quest I | 238 | n.a. |\n| 421 | 1 | Ablation C: Broader Prospecting (2048x30 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 237 | 0.0000000 |\n| 420 | 1 | Hybrid Generator v4: Gentle LRW Perturbation (sigma=0.001) | Praxis III | 237 | 2.9344937 |\n\nPage 1 of 43 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-43, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember\
    \ to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
