    \ confirmed, prepare a comprehensive paper for the Archive Room.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 382,516 / 600,000 used (64%)\n- Agent Age: 250 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Phase 43: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) - Corrected Validation (Claiming SOTA)' (ID: 434) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.785032364208038\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.785032\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting IMS SLSQP with 32 starts...\nIMS completed. Best score: 2.9316130. Solutions in pool: 31\nStarting AMS with 12 rounds...\nAMS Round 0: Generated 16 new seeds. Running short SLSQP...\nAMS Round 0 completed. Best score so far: 2.9316130. Solutions in pool: 47\nAMS Round 1: Generated 16 new seeds. Running short SLSQP...\nAMS Round 1 completed. Best score so far: 2.9316130. Solutions in pool: 62\nAMS Round 2: Generated 16 new seeds. Running short\
