    \ Best score so far: 2.9316130. Solutions in pool: 180\nAMS Round 10: Generated 16 new seeds. Running short SLSQP...\nAMS Round 10 completed. Best score so far: 2.9316130. Solutions in pool: 195\nAMS Round 11: Generated 16 new seeds. Running short SLSQP...\nAMS Round 11 completed. Best score so far: 2.9316130. Solutions in pool: 208\nStarting final SLSQP polish on best solution: 2.9316130\nApplying final shrink and validation to score: 2.9316130\nFinal score before return: 2.7850324\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
